<%# PRD §8.2 — cookie notice. We set no analytics/marketing cookies, only
    strictly-necessary ones (session, CSRF protection, theme preference), so
    this is a notice rather than a consent gate — see /privacy-policy §6. %>
<div class="cookie-banner" data-cookie-banner hidden>
  <p class="cookie-banner__text">
    We use essential cookies to keep you signed in, protect your session and
    remember your theme preference. We don't use analytics or advertising
    cookies. See our <a href="/privacy-policy">privacy policy</a> for details.
  </p>
  <button class="button button--primary button--small" type="button" data-cookie-dismiss>
    Got it
  </button>
</div>
